OL,3,GNEWSABeing a GP in the summer 'getting
OL,4,Amore difficult'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealth leaders say repeated heatwaves
OL,7,Fand an influx of holidaymakers are
OL,8,Fputting growing pressure on NHS
OL,9,Fservices across Somerset.
OL,11,FNHS England said A&E departments hit a
OL,12,Frecord 2.5 million attendances in July
OL,13,Fduring two heatwaves, describing the
OL,14,Frise in demand as a national "summer
OL,15,Fsurge".
OL,17,FIn West Somerset, GP Dr David Davies
OL,18,Fsaid hot weather had made it "a very
OL,19,Fdifficult summer", with more people
OL,20,Fseeking treatment for heat-related
OL,21,Fillnesses.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
