OL,3,GNEWSABeing a GP in the summer 'getting
OL,4,Amore difficult'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavies said his practice in Dunster, on
OL,7,Fthe edge of Exmoor, had treated
OL,8,Ftourists for heatstroke, heat rash,
OL,9,Finsect stings and tick bites, while
OL,10,Fsome had arrived without enough
OL,11,Fprescription medication.
